{
    "title": "Rummy 500",
    "description": "Now with a brand new Online Multiplayer mode! Compete for Weekly prizes and enjoy all your favorite game modes with players from around the world!\r\n\r\nThis latest release also brings in a new Boss Battle mode for our most engaged users! Play against King Rummy and win exciting prizes!\r\n\r\nRummy 500 is the BEST Rummy game created for Android. Rummy 500 offers four levels of difficulty, 6 unique game modes as well as extensive statistics tracking. It is an unparalleled game play experience!\r\n\r\nNow with 7 unique themes and great daily challenges! Customize your game to your liking and come back every day for a new chance to earn additional coins and unlock the latest theme!\r\n\r\nAlso includes Facebook integration! Personalize your game, earn experience with every game, never lose your statistics! Your statistics are now stored in the cloud and shared between all your devices.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2022 Realistic gameplay and graphics\r\n\u2022 Intuitive single player gameplay\r\n\u2022 4 difficulty options\r\n\u2022 6 game modes: Regular, 3-Player, Speed Rummy, Team Play, Persian and Dealer's Gambit.\r\n\u2022 Extensive Statistics, including games and hands breakdown.\r\n\u2022 Facebook integration - personalize your game and save your progress.\r\n\u2022 7 unique themes to customize your game play experience!\r\n\u2022 Daily Challenges! Come back every day for an additional chance to earn coins!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Now with a brand new Online Multiplayer mode! Compete for Weekly prizes and enjoy all your favorite game modes with players from around the world!<br><br>This latest release also brings in a new Boss Battle mode for our most engaged users! Play against King Rummy and win exciting prizes!<br><br>Rummy 500 is the BEST Rummy game created for Android. Rummy 500 offers four levels of difficulty, 6 unique game modes as well as extensive statistics tracking. It is an unparalleled game play experience!<br><br>Now with 7 unique themes and great daily challenges! Customize your game to your liking and come back every day for a new chance to earn additional coins and unlock the latest theme!<br><br>Also includes Facebook integration! Personalize your game, earn experience with every game, never lose your statistics! Your statistics are now stored in the cloud and shared between all your devices.<br><br>Features:<br>\u2022 Realistic gameplay and graphics<br>\u2022 Intuitive single player gameplay<br>\u2022 4 difficulty options<br>\u2022 6 game modes: Regular, 3-Player, Speed Rummy, Team Play, Persian and Dealer&#39;s Gambit.<br>\u2022 Extensive Statistics, including games and hands breakdown.<br>\u2022 Facebook integration - personalize your game and save your progress.<br>\u2022 7 unique themes to customize your game play experience!<br>\u2022 Daily Challenges! Come back every day for an additional chance to earn coins!",
    "summary": "Now with Online Multiplayer! Have you had the chance to battle King Rummy yet?",
